@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Login (JetBrains HTTP Client response handler)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo","password":"demo123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token); %}

### Create conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Mock SSE demo","modelCode":"mock"}

> {% client.global.set("conversationId", response.body.data); %}

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversation/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stream: expect 20 deltas approximately 500ms apart, then done
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversationId":{{conversationId}},"modelCode":"mock","content":"Hello"}

### Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversation/{{conversationId}}/messages?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/conversation/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token: HTTP 200, body.status=401
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversation/list
